              "name": "Allrecipes Member"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Loved this recipe! I made it for company to serve as a side dish to some paella, and it was fantabulous! Very easy to make, and has a wonderful texture, like bread pudding. Highly recommend trying this one!"
          },
