            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "INESPR"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Fantastic!! I tweaked a bit: used pineapple in chunks and used tapioca instead of the breadcrumbs ( 2 1/2 cups), used whipped cream ( from heavy cream) to make it look fancy, and my kids LOVED IT! I whipped the heavy cream without any sugar and it helped to balanced out the sweetness of the other ingredients. I used it as a dessert, but I would use it as a side dish next. Easy to prepare, too.",
            "datePublished": "2017-01-17T20:17:20.723Z"
          },
          {
