              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Kathi Summerfield"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My family loves this. This is the second year I've made it and this time I found Hawaiian Bread. It was good with plain white bread but a bit less sweet. Next time I'll make it with a good oat bread.",
            "datePublished": "2009-12-21T17:11:43.210Z"
