            "reviewBody": "This recipe was perfect for what I was looking for! I wanted a pineapple dessert, and this one really hit the spot.\n\nThe last time I made this, I was doubling the recipe when I realized I only had one can of pineapple. I added a can of peaches, drained and diced, instead. A little bit of toasted coconut on top after baking, and we had the perfect tropical treat.",
